abstract: >-
  A manifest-driven R pipeline for acquiring and preparing public-use NHANES
  Complete Blood Count and Demographics data for 1999–2000 through 2017–2018.
  The software records source hashes and validation summaries, separates the
  unweighted 2001–2002 repeat examination, and preserves primary sample keys
  when joining CBC and Demographics. It includes reproducible dependencies,
  synthetic tests and educational documentation. Appropriate survey weights
  and cross-cycle scientific comparability remain analyst responsibilities.
